   "nameZh": "安東尼·希林",
   "recordIds": [],
   "thickness": "中",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "ord": 1,
     "period": {
      "start": "1884-08-31",
      "end": "1912-01-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與早年",
      "en": "Early life"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "安東尼·希林（Antoni Szylling）1884年8月31日生於普沃尼亞維（Płoniawy），1971年6月17日卒於蒙特婁。他1904年畢業於華沙商業學校，1910至1912年就讀華沙高等農業學校，並是波蘭社會黨（PPS）的活躍分子。1905年被徵召入伍，因屬政治犯，即使有學歷仍先當列兵、後任士官，在第90步兵團服役兩年。",
      "en": "Antoni Szylling was born on 31 August 1884 in Płoniawy and died on 17 June 1971 in Montreal. He finished the Commercial School in Warsaw in 1904 and attended the Higher School of Agriculture there in 1910–1912, and was an active member of the PPS. He was called up in 1905 and, as a political offender, despite his education served two years as a private and then NCO in the 90th Infantry Regiment."
     },
