    {
     "ord": 2,
     "period": {
      "start": "1914-01-01",
      "end": "1922-03-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "month",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "俄軍與波蘭軍團長",
      "en": "Russian army and early Polish commands"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1914至1917年他動員入俄軍，任連長與營長。1917年12月起任第二波蘭軍團第5步兵團團長，Kaniów 戰後自1918年5月落入德軍俘虜。1918年11月起在波蘭軍隊服役；1919年5月至1921年9月任第44邊區步兵團團長，之後任第13步兵師步兵指揮官，1922年2月應己請轉入預備役。",
      "en": "Mobilised, he served in the Russian army in 1914–1917 as a company and battalion commander. From December 1917 he commanded the 5th Rifle Regiment in the II Polish Corps, and after the battle of Kaniów he was a German prisoner from May 1918. He was in the Polish Army from November 1918; from May 1919 to September 1921 he commanded the 44th Kresy Rifle Regiment, then was infantry commander of the 13th Infantry Division, and in February 1922 he was moved to the reserve at his own request."
     },
